"shopify:\/\/products\/super-mint-toothpaste"}},"template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SUPER-BRUSH-KITS.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"SUPERBRUSH kits","link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/superbrush-kits"}},"template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Banner_Image_Marble.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"Kids SuperBrush","link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/kids"}},"template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Super-Brush-Heads.jpg","title":"","text":"","link_label":"SUPERBrush Heads","link":"https:\/\/sevenoralcare.com\/collections\/superbrush-heads"}}},"block_order":["50667cf3-adb4-446d-8c58-4a0d3c660268","template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-0","template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-2","template--18163413647678__d0730a98-e8e7-4fa9-bc63-c308737de8ce-168199535433fecc03-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Shop our superstars","subtext":"","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":2,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":0}},"0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc":{"type":"testimonial-sec","blocks":{"template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Never ever had fresher breath in my life!","text":"<p>I never really thought about brushing too much and then I saw this pink brush and it’s so beautiful I had to buy it! It is my first time using an electric toothbrush and I like the moon mode the most. My teeth also feel much cleaner and I have less bad breath than before. Definitely recommend this to everyone!<\/p>","link_label":"Karishhma M,","link_label1":"Delhi","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_1.1.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/the-sonic-toothbrush-dusty-rose-edition"}},"template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Love that I can happily brush in the shower!","text":"<p>I have used an electric toothbrush before but this one is a complete game changer - I have the black one and I can happily brush in the shower because I’m always running late. It’s actually waterproof and I can be super lazy because it has a 2min timer so I brush till the timer goes off.  Best buy ever!<\/p>","link_label":"Nikhil M,","link_label1":"Mumbai","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_2.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/superbrush-kits"}},"template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"60 days battery life is a game changer.","text":"<p>My dentist advised me to use an electric toothbrush because I have bleeding gums. I tried many and then always stopped using it because I kept forgetting to charge it. This 60 day battery life has totally sorted me out because I don’t need to carry my charger even when I travel. My teeth and gums are sensitive. I'm enjoying the last mode the most because it feels nice and not very harsh.<\/p>","link_label":"Harshali T,","link_label1":"Chennai","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_3.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/products\/the-sonic-toothbrush-lavender-edition"}},"6209f0a2-47ef-436d-a883-9665d8f61f32":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","title":"Cutest matching mint brush and travel case - and super hygienic!","text":"<p>For someone who would totally skip her night brushing because of crazy work hours to now waiting to brush with my new mint sonic toothbrush, I’m enjoying my oral care as much as skincare. I feel like my teeth are actually looking less yellow and feel much cleaner. And how cute is that matching travel case with it! <\/p>","link_label":"Vedd R,","link_label1":"Bangalore","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_4.jpg","link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/superbrush-kits"}}},"block_order":["template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-0","template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-1","template--18163413647678__0dfd751e-2f28-409a-a70b-59feb33fe4fc-1682055923477f2901-2","6209f0a2-47ef-436d-a883-9665d8f61f32"],"settings":{"title":"Can’t stop smiling :)","heading_size":"h1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"adapt","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"left","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"95b965d1-975b-4e63-b15d-a6df120fc417":{"type":"custom-liquid","disabled":true,"settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div class=\"marquee\">\n  <div class=\"track\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t&nbsp;The future of Oral  Care <span>>><\/span>\n\t<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":52}},"07652fc8-000f-4cb9-86fc-170091db1478":{"type":"shop-the-look","blocks":{"template--18163413647678__07652fc8-000f-4cb9-86fc-170091db1478-1682420920c4acf518-0":{"type":"look","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_im